"id\": \"A09\",\n155:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p0_recovery.py\",\n156:    \"phase\": \"P0\",\n157:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n158:    \"type\": \"positive\"\n159:   },\n160:   {\n161:    \"features\": [\n162:     \"F10\"\n163:    ],\n164:    \"goal\": \"未知 id 与畸形 JSON 返回结构化错误（bad_request/not_found）且不产生 5xx、不改变数据；真实表单的非法 URL 显示可读 form-error、保留输入，并在修正后成功保存。\",\n165:    \"id\": \"A10\",\n166:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p0_recovery.py\",\n167:    \"phase\": \"P0\",\n168:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n169:    \"type\": \"negative\"\n170:   },\n171:   {\n172:    \"features\": [\n173:     \"F11\"\n174:    ],\n175:    \"goal\": \"健康检查返回就绪，首页外壳在空库下渲染录入表单与列表容器，入口不报错。\",\n176:    \"id\": \"A11\",\n177:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p0_library.py\",\n178:    \"phase\": \"P0\",\n179:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n180:    \"type\": \"positive\"\n181:   },\n182:   {\n183:    \"features\": [\n184:     \"F01\",\n185:     \"F04\",\n186:     \"F10\"\n187:    ],\n188:    \"goal\": \"仅验证书签保存与移动的非法归类：HTML 保存使用归类名 category，HTML 移动使用归类 ID category_id；JSON 保存/移动使用归类名 category。非法归类 400 invalid_category，HTML 显示可读 form-error 并保留提交值，JSON 返回结构化错误；归类集合、记录集合与被移动记录归属均不变。保存省略 category（JSON 另含 null）进入未整理，不作为非法值；移动省略值/JSON null、显式空值/纯空白/超长归类名，以及 HTML 移动空/未知 category_id 为非法。有效新归类名保存或 JSON 移动时自动创建，不把未知 ID 当作名称。分类创建/重命名 name 的 invalid_name 分支仅属 A04。\",\n189:    \"id\": \"A12\",\n190:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p0_organize.py\",\n191:    \"phase\": \"P0\",\n192:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n193:    \"type\": \"negative\"\n194:   },\n195:   {\n196:    \"features\": [\n197:     \"F12\"\n198:    ],\n199:    \"goal\": \"外部网络不可用时保存仍然成功，图标与标题降级为本地派生结果，缺失增强不阻塞或报错。\",\n200:    \"id\": \"A13\",\n201:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p1_maturity.py\",\n202:    \"phase\": \"P1\",\n203:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n204:    \"type\": \"positive\"\n205:   },\n206:   {\n207:    \"features\": [\n208:     \"F13\"\n209:    ],\n210:    \"goal\": \"导出为浏览器书签 HTML 可包含已存记录，且导入该 HTML 后相应记录可再次检索到。\",\n211:    \"id\": \"A14\",\n212:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p1_maturity.py\",\n213:    \"phase\": \"P1\",\n214:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n215:    \"type\": \"positive\"\n216:   },\n217:   {\n218:    \"features\": [\n219:     \"F14\"\n220:    ],\n221:    \"goal\": \"重复 URL 默认被拒绝（409 duplicate_url）且库不变；显式允许重复时可新增第二条。\",\n222:    \"id\": \"A15\",\n223:    \"implementation\": \"acceptance/p1_maturity.py\",\n224:    \"phase\": \"P1\",\n225:    \"status\": \"not_run\",\n226:    \"type\": \"negative\"\n227:   }\n228:  ]\n229: }"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"source/candidate/generated-metadata/acceptance/plan.json\",\"limit\":2000}"},"time":{"start":1792484214062,"end":1792484214237}}}}
